<title>USA: Millennia sets unit spin-off distributions.</title>
<headline>Millennia sets unit spin-off distributions.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennia Inc said its board authorized a partial spinoff of two of the company's wholly owned units, Omni Doors Inc and Millennia Entertainment Inc.</p>
<p>Millennia said its shareholders will receive one share in each of the units for every four Millennia shares they hold.</p>
<p>The company said it will announce a record date for the distribution after the Securities and Exchange Commission registration statement relating to the issuance becomes effective.</p>
<p>Millennia said it will continue to own 90 percent of the units after the distribution.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
